@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# meterly
+
+Subscription billing service. Modules live in `src/<module>/`, HTTP handlers in `src/api/`, scheduled
+jobs in `src/jobs/`, and shared infrastructure in `src/infra/`. `src/app.js` wires the service together.
+
+- `accounts`: customer accounts and their settings
+- `plans`: the plan catalogue and prices
+- `subscriptions`: who is on which plan, renewals and cancellation
+- `usage`: metered usage per subscription period
+- `invoicing`: invoices, charging and dunning
+- `notifications`: emails sent on account and billing events
+- `admin`: back-office views
+
+`npm test` runs the suite.
